        "use": "armorpieces.fittings"
      }
    },
    "name": "Fittings",
    "root": "../..",
    "sections": {
      "about": "Some pieces have a second colour, set separately: a gem in the circlet, a metal buckle and a\ndyed strap on the sash, an inlay on the greaves, a banner on the back banner. A piece declares\nthe places it has for one, and a **fitting template** fills each.\n",
      "configuration": false,
